@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@supplierId = 678

### Buscar proveedores
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers?q=INTERLOMAS&status=all&page=1&pageSize=25

### Primer proveedor
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/first

### Ficha
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}

### Anterior / siguiente
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/previous

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/next

### Alta → Valores iniciales del formulario
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/create

### Alta → OK en una base de prueba
# @name createCatalogSupplier
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestKey": "{{$guid}}",
  "fields": {
    "code": "WT0001", "name": "PROVEEDOR PRUEBA WEB", "notes": "",
    "address": { "street": "", "neighborhood": "", "city": "", "state": "", "postalCode": "" },
    "contact": { "name": "", "phone": "", "phone2": "", "fax": "", "email": "" },
    "fiscal": { "taxId": "", "curp": "", "accountingAccount": "2001001" },
    "terms": { "priceList": 1, "discounts": [0, 0], "paymentTermDays": 0, "creditLimit": 0, "currencyId": 1, "type": 0, "applyToSupplierCode": "" }
  }
}

### Cambio → Revisión de la ficha y condición para Baja
# @name catalogSupplierEdit
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{createCatalogSupplier.response.body.$.data.id}}/edit

### Cambio → OK
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{createCatalogSupplier.response.body.$.data.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "revision": "{{catalogSupplierEdit.response.body.$.data.revision}}",
  "fields": {
    "code": "WT0001", "name": "PROVEEDOR PRUEBA WEB EDITADO", "notes": "",
    "address": { "street": "", "neighborhood": "", "city": "", "state": "", "postalCode": "" },
    "contact": { "name": "", "phone": "", "phone2": "", "fax": "", "email": "" },
    "fiscal": { "taxId": "", "curp": "", "accountingAccount": "2001001" },
    "terms": { "priceList": 1, "discounts": [0, 0], "paymentTermDays": 0, "creditLimit": 0, "currencyId": 1, "type": 0, "applyToSupplierCode": "" }
  }
}

### Baja → Obtener revisión vigente y confirmar sólo sobre el proveedor de prueba
# @name catalogSupplierRemoval
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{createCatalogSupplier.response.body.$.data.id}}/edit

### Baja → Sí
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{createCatalogSupplier.response.body.$.data.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "revision": "{{catalogSupplierRemoval.response.body.$.data.revision}}", "confirmed": true }

### Acciones: clasificar, bloqueo, descuentos, eventos, varios y contactos
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/actions/classifications?position=1

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/actions/block-status

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/actions/discounts

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/actions/events

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/actions/various

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts-payable/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/actions/contacts

